{"shots": [{"badge": "ON AIR", "loc": "Garage", "scene": "hook", "vo": "Base to Rookie, over. They gave you the *Solntsepyok*. I repeat: *don't press anything*."}, {"badge": "ON AIR", "loc": "Garage", "scene": "inside", "vo": "Under you: almost *fifty tons*. A T-72 tank below, twenty-four tubes on top.", "card": "weight"}, {"badge": "ON AIR", "loc": "Cabin", "scene": "cabin", "vo": "It's cramped like a can of sardines. The crew is *three people*. Right now, it's just you."}, {"badge": "ON AIR", "loc": "Garage", "scene": "fence", "vo": "Simple task: drive to the range. Start it up. *Eight hundred forty* horsepower. No, it's not a tractor. Rookie, *that was a fence*.", "card": "hp"}, {"badge": "ON AIR", "loc": "Road", "scene": "road", "vo": "Fine, we'll write off the fence. It does *thirty-seven* miles an hour, but it brakes like an apartment block. So turn early. *Early, Rookie!*"}, {"badge": "ON AIR", "loc": "Firing range", "scene": "range", "vo": "You're at the range. Target: an old hill. It's almost *four miles* away — that's the limit.", "card": "range"}, {"badge": "ON AIR", "loc": "Firing range", "scene": "wait", "vo": "Good news: the computer figures out where to fly. Bad news: it takes *a minute and a half* to get ready. Ninety seconds of silence. Rookie, *don't sneeze on the panel*.", "card": "timer"}, {"badge": "ON AIR", "loc": "Firing range", "scene": "salvo", "vo": "Cleared. Fire. *Twenty-four rockets in six seconds*. Each one weighs nearly five hundred pounds. A *second sun* rises over the hill.", "card": "salvo"}, {"badge": "ON AIR", "loc": "Firing range", "scene": "fired", "vo": "Rookie, come in… Silence. Rookie, *you're fired*. That fence belonged to *a general*."}, {"badge": "", "loc": "", "scene": "end", "vo": "Would *you* risk pressing the button?"}], "meta": [{"dur": 6.267270833333333, "phr": [[0, 0.9688541666666667, "Base to Rookie,"], [1.1888541666666668, 1.7046875000000001, "over."], [2.1546875, 3.799625, "They gave you the *Solntsepyok*."], [4.